        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "罗喉白蚁从正面侵入，会导致牛羊公事受损及人丁减少。水从左边或右边流入，需观察其气脉才能完全知晓吉凶。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000687-p000-280e144cba",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "脐穴属于紫气，对应紫微、太乙、火、元、明堂、贵人、巨门、阳等神煞。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
